{
  "openapi": "3.0.1",
  "info": {
    "title": "CashOrCrash Game API",
    "description": "## API Overview\n### 使用說明\n\n1. 使用 RESTful 端點發送行為請求。\n2. 連接到 WebSocket 服務器以獲取遊戲狀態即時更新。\n\n### Init Game Flow\n1. 平台方與 Funky 取得 launch info \n   1. 此次請求會取得 launch game url 以及一組 token，以下統稱 session token\n2. 開啟前端 client，發送 consumePlayer 請求並且帶上 session token 用以驗證\n   1. 此次請求會取得另一組 token，以下統稱 auth token\n   2. auth token 保留，後續 request 都需要將此 token 帶入 header Authorization 欄位\n3. 發送 gameInfo 請求\n   1. 此次請求會取得玩家 & 遊戲的當前基本資訊，以及 socketUrl + socketToken\n4. 使用 socketUrl + socketToken 建立 ws 連線\n5. 始可開始進行遊戲操作\n\n### Api Error Code Mapping\n\n```\nNoError = 0,\nTokenExpired = 1,\nBadAuthorization = 2,\nInvalidInput = 3,\nOverBetCredit = 4,\nOverPlayerMaxWin = 5,\nOverPlayerMaxLose = 6,\nPlayerIsNotLogin = 7,\nApiSuspended = 8,\nInternalError = 9,\nOverMaxBet = 10,\nLowerThanMinBet = 11,\nBetTooFrequent = 12,\nApiError = 13,\nInputIncorrect = 14,\nInvalidGameStatus = 15,\nCannotFindOldLiveGameId = 16,\nBetNotFound = 17,\nBetSettled = 18,\nBetCanceled = 19,\nBetExisted = 20,\nInsufficientBalance = 21,\nBadRequest = 22,\nUnauthorized = 23,\nForbidden = 24,\nOperatorInternalServerError = 25,\nExitedOrdersCannotChangeTableLimit = 26,\nVoucherIsNotValid = 27,\nVoucherNotApplied = 28,\nCanNotFindTableLimit = 29,\nGetPlayerFail = 30,\nGameIsMaintain = 31,\nTableLimitNotFound = 32,\nBetIsRunning = 33,\nInternalServerError = 500,\nDBError = 29999,\nBetWasCanceled = 30000,\nInvalidPlayerConnectionStatus = 30001,\n```\n",
    "version": "v1"
  },
