    "/gameChannels": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "WebSocket info"
        ],
        "summary": "WebSocket Connection",
        "description": "## WebSocket Info\n\n後端會持續發送訊息，並使用 `action` 欄位（數字類型）來標註訊息的類型和狀態。<br>以下是定義的所有動作及其詳細說明\n\n## 訊息類型概覽\n\n以下是所有支援的動作類型及其對應的 `action` 編號：\n\n- **JOIN_GAME**: 0\n- **UPDATE_PLAYER_COUNT**: 1（已棄用）\n- **OPEN_BET**: 2\n- **CLOSE_BET**: 3\n- **GAME_RESULT**: 4\n- **BET_RESULT**: 5\n- **SYNC_TIMER**: 8\n- **GET_HISTORY**: 10\n- **UPDATE_OTHER_CHIPS**: 11\n- **GET_BALANCE**: 12\n- **DRAWING**: 14\n- **CASH_OUT**: 15\n\n---\n\n### JOIN_GAME (action: 0)\n\n- **描述**: 新的一局遊戲開啟。\n- **範例**:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"createdGameTime\": \"2025-03-19T23:15:38.244671-04:00\",\n    \"liveGameId\": 4112336109,\n    \"action\": 0\n  }\n  ```\n\n### ~~*UPDATE_PLAYER_COUNT*~~ (action: 1)\n\n- **描述**: 已棄用\n- **範例**: 已棄用\n\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"action\": 1,\n    \"activePlayer\": 5,\n    \"gameManagerId\": \"default\",\n    \"gameManagerType\": \"602817\"\n  }\n  ```\n\n### OPEN_BET (action: 2)\n\n- **描述**: 新的一局開始\n  - `(countDown)` 該局開始倒數的秒數\n- **範例**:\n  ```json\n  { \"countDown\": 10, \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 2 }\n  ```\n\n### CLOSE_BET (action: 3)\n\n- **描述**: 停止收注\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 3 }\n  ```\n\n### GAME_RESULT (action: 4)\n\n- **描述**: 火箭爆炸，爆炸時的秒數及結果\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"currentSecond\": 5.8, \"odds\": 3.7, \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 4 }\n  ```\n\n### BET_RESULT (action: 5)\n\n- **描述**: 後端結算\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 5 }\n  ```\n\n### SYNC_TIMER (action: 8)\n\n- **描述**:\n  - `(countDown)` 現在秒數值，每秒更新，第一個訊息與 OPEN_BET 同時\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"countDown\": 10, \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 8 }\n  { \"countDown\": 9, \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 8 }\n  ```\n\n### GET_HISTORY (action: 10)\n\n- **描述**: 過去 30 局結果，最高長度為 30，新紀錄會出現在陣列前面，超過 30 局會 pop 掉舊的資料\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"gameHistory\": [\n      1.62, 2.23, 1.07, 1.7, 1.41, 1.23, 1.62, 2.04, 1.29, 1.17, 1.23, 1.29,\n      4.45, 0.0, 1.02, 1.86, 1.41, 2.57, 7.73, 1.7, 0.0, 1.48, 3.23, 8.47, 1.12,\n      3.7, 0.0, 1.95, 1.23, 20.28\n    ],\n    \"liveGameId\": 4112336109,\n    \"action\": 10\n  }\n  ```\n\n### UPDATE_OTHER_CHIPS (action: 11)\n\n- **描述**:\n  - `(onBoards)` 目前上船人數，\n  - `(othersPlayers)` 最新上船玩家列表，最高長度為 12，新上船的玩家會出現在陣列前面，超過 12 人會 pop 掉舊的資料\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"onBoards\": 3,\n    \"othersPlayers\": [\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***608\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+bngiy95v+608\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***171\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+68j8warj+171\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***040\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+fc1apezc+040\" }\n    ],\n    \"liveGameId\": 4112336109,\n    \"action\": 11\n  }\n  {\n    \"onBoards\": 13,\n    \"othersPlayers\": [\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***187\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+jow5gj6h+187\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***862\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+6wg3vjg0+862\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***961\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+bxukmsdd+961\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***316\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+zawrrbt3+316\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***774\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+jktjn0sv+774\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***694\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+46e4dpny+694\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***379\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+5ep4dn0f+379\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***572\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+gx2mx1ht+572\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***796\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+y22wf574+796\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***302\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+r4djmzdh+302\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***608\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+bngiy95v+608\" },\n        { \"playerName\": \"FI***171\", \"playerId\": \"FIB+68j8warj+171\" }\n    ],\n    \"liveGameId\": 4112336109,\n    \"action\": 11\n    }\n  ```\n\n### GET_BALANCE (action: 12)\n\n- **描述**: 提醒前端發送 get balance 請求\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 12 }\n  ```\n\n### DRAWING (action: 14)\n\n- **描述**: 火箭進度\n  - `(currentSecond)` 當前經過的秒數\n  - `(odds)` 當前賠率\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"currentSecond\": 5.6, \"odds\": 3.54, \"liveGameId\": 4112336109, \"action\": 14 }\n  ```\n\n### CASH_OUT (action: 15)\n\n- **描述**: 在 DRAWING 階段時會不定時發送\n  - `(onBoards)` 目前仍在船上人數，\n  - `(othersCashOut)` 最近 12 個 cashout 的玩家，最高長度為 12，\n  - `(oddsCount)` 與上次收到該訊息時的資料相比，新跳出的玩家賠率及人數統計\n- **範例**:\n\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"onBoards\": 13,\n    \"othersCashOut\": [\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***353\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+nyjxfmvn+353\",\n        \"odds\": 1.95\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***131\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+7qnxt9cr+131\",\n        \"odds\": 1.86\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***664\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+fxx18wrx+664\",\n        \"odds\": 1.86\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***428\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+6h9xsdqu+428\",\n        \"odds\": 1.35\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***171\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+sey7uyoo+171\",\n        \"odds\": 1.35\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***821\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+jdrniwq1+821\",\n        \"odds\": 1.35\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***679\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+p5i5mi0u+679\",\n        \"odds\": 1.12\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***303\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+yecn8s7t+303\",\n        \"odds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***208\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+7oz615ev+208\",\n        \"odds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***671\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+uaw3ay98+671\",\n        \"odds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***831\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+3mxkhb7f+831\",\n        \"odds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"playerName\": \"FI***913\",\n        \"playerId\": \"FIB+fipcmie9+913\",\n        \"odds\": 0.0\n      }\n    ],\n    \"oddsCount\": [\n      { \"odds\": 1.95, \"count\": 1 },\n      { \"odds\": 1.86, \"count\": 2 }\n    ],\n    \"liveGameId\": 4112336109,\n    \"action\": 15\n  }\n  ```\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "wsToken",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Bearer token for WebSocket authentication, you can get it from the game info api.",
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "101": {
            "description": "Switching Protocols - WebSocket connection established"
          }
        },
        "servers": [
          {
            "url": "wss://fs7vsd7tav.highplayfky.com"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/common/consumeplayer": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "ConsumePlayer"
        ],
        "summary": "Consume player session",
        "description": "Call external backend to consume player session using a session token.",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "required": [
                  "sessionToken"
                ],
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "sessionToken": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "returnCode": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "format": "int32"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "authToken": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
